{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 43, :comments ["<b>And they shall be on Aaron.</b> All these garments — on Aaron, those that are fitting for him." "<b>And on his sons.</b> Those mentioned regarding them." "<b>When they come into the Tent of Meeting.</b> To the Temple, and likewise to the Tabernacle." "<b>And they shall die.</b> From this you learn that one who serves lacking garments is liable to death." "<b>An everlasting statute for him.</b> Wherever חֻקַּת עוֹלָם is stated, it is a decree forthwith and for generations, to penalize for its violation (Menachot 19)."], :book :exodus, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 28, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T08:55:25.072745642Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}